    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d509">

                <pb facs="0727" n="717" sameAs="frus:frus1945v03/pg717"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.62114A/4–2545: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Switzerland</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Harrison</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bern</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-04-25">April 25,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received April 25—5 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2438. Your 1507, April 19th.<anchor n="12" xml:id="d509-f1"/> Foreign Office note
                    April 24 states message telegraphed Swiss Legation Berlin. Additionally, in
                    accordance desire of Department, Foreign Office transmitted <hi
                        rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> containing terms of German proposal
                    and acceptance thereof by United States to German Legation Bern. This <hi
                        rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> dated April 21 delivered same day
                    German Legation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Harrison</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d509-f1" n="12" xml:id="d509-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed; it instructed the Minister to inform the German Government that it
                    should leave in camp all prisoners of war as Allies advanced
                    (711.62114A/4–1145).</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
